        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Yale YMRC-NIL, Yale Expressions Nils Lever with Modern Marcel Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Nils Lever with Marcel Rosette is from Yale's Expressions series. This leverset was made with the end user in mind. From easy ordering to its easy installation, you can be sure that the Marcel Rosette with Nils Lever will be the perfect fit for your door. The Yale Expressions Nils Lever with Modern Marcel Rosette is available as a dummy, passage function, privacy lever, and a keyed lever in several of the most popular finish colors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Contemporary Nils Door Lever with Modern Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Nils Leverset with Marcel Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Keyed Entry has a Schlage C keyway.</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/YAL-YMRC25-NIL-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262432\"><b>Yale YMRC-NIL Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. \r\nLever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face). \r\nPackage Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Turnbutton on interior lever engages privacy lock on both levers; emergency release hole is on exterior lever. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed:</b> Guarded latchbolt operated from outside by key; inside by lever. \r\nTurnbutton on the interior locks outside lever. Outside lever unlocks by key. \r\nComplete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Nils Lever with Marcel Rosette",
                "description": "The Nils Lever with Marcel Rosette is from Yale's Expressions series. This leverset was made with the end user in mind. From easy ordering to its easy installation, you can be sure that the Marcel Rosette with Nils Lever will be the perfect fit for your door. The Yale Expressions Nils Lever with Modern Marcel Rosette is available as a dummy, passage function, privacy lever, and a keyed entry lever in several of the most popular finish colors.",
